            "texttype":"Online",
            "textpurpose":"Description",
            "textentryhtml":"In-folded, slightly everted rim; tall conical body, constricted at its base toward the pushed-in base. Fine thread is wound spirally eighteen times around the body. Four trails of glass extend from the lower body to the rim, looped four to five times against the body. At the center of the bottom is a faint, annular pontil mark, 1 cm. wide.<?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /><o:p></o:p>",
